{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "来不及看方案了  (No Time to Show the Boss)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Qin Xiao drops by the chief editor's office to announce that the pitch meeting has been moved forward, leaving Xingzi and Bu Xiaogu scrambling to protect Chun Yuqiao's hospital rest. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "几个意思啊？本来就没有给我们几天时间准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么方案会还提前了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我哪知道啊，这是上面的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "没什么事我就先走了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不送了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我总觉得这小秦有点幸灾乐祸的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想起来了，你们俩是仇人对不对？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么办啊？来不及给淳于总看方案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "别着急，咱们就按照原计划进行，方案会那天听天由命吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？听天由命？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然呢？去医院打扰老大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说好了啊，不能去，谁都不能去啊！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "几个意思啊？本来就没有给我们几天时间准备。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the meaning of this? We barely had a few days to prepare in the first place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么方案会还提前了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could the proposal meeting be moved even earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我哪知道啊，这是上面的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How would I know? Those are orders from higher up.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "没什么事我就先走了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If there is nothing else, I will head off now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不送了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not let me keep you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我总觉得这小秦有点幸灾乐祸的意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot help feeling Qin Xiao is gloating over our trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想起来了，你们俩是仇人对不对？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now I remember—the two of you are old rivals, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么办啊？来不及给淳于总看方案了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do we do? There is no time left to show Mr Chun Yuqiao the proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "别着急，咱们就按照原计划进行，方案会那天听天由命吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stay calm; we stick to the original plan and leave things to fate on pitch day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？听天由命？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Leave it to fate?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然呢？去医院打扰老大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What else—go disturb the boss in hospital?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说好了啊，不能去，谁都不能去啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then it is settled—nobody goes, not a single one of us!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "几个意思啊？本来就没有给我们几天时间准备。",
      "gap": 0.5
